  "instructions": [
    "Heat the ghee in a pan over medium heat. Add the onion and garlic and cook until softened.",
    "Add the ume-plum, tumeric, cumin, salt, and black pepper. Cook for 2 minutes.",
    "Add the fenugreek and berbere spice. Cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Add the flour and water. Stir until the mixture thickens.",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer for 10 minutes.",
    "Serve hot and garnish with chopped onion and ume-plum.",
    "If desired, flambé with a small amount of water and ghee to crisp the onions.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy!"
